// # llvm mul div mod precedence
//
// Logline: LLVM pass fixture for STAR SLASH PERCENT with C-like precedence.
//
// Beats:
//   1. main prints mul div mod and mixed-precedence values.
//   2. STAR binds tighter than PLUS and MINUS.
//   3. Output is 7 4 9 6 2.

pub fn main() {
    println(1 + 2 * 3);
    println(10 - 2 * 3);
    println((1 + 2) * 3);
    println(20 / 4 + 1);
    println(20 % 6);
}
